# MDC File Format Guide

MDC files provide context-specific instructions to the AI.

## Frontmatter

```
---
description: Brief description of what the rule does
globs: **/*.js, **/*.ts  # Optional: comma-separated list
alwaysApply: false       # Set to true for global rules
---
```

- `globs`: leave empty for highly specific rules loaded by intent; set `alwaysApply: true` for global ones

## Content
Use normal Markdown with headings and concise, actionable guidelines.

## Best Practices
- Number files by importance (e.g., `010-...`) to keep ordering clear
- Split large topics; keep files focused
- Reference other rules with `mdc:` links if needed

## Renames/Removals
- When adding/renaming/removing rules, keep numeric ordering coherent and filenames descriptive
